# Lost in the Maze: "When this enchantment enters, tap X target creatures. Put a stun counter on each of those creatures you don't
# control. Tapped creatures you control have hexproof." Cast with X = 2 ({2}{U}{U}) on Bot1's own Ornithopter (a second, untapped one is left alone) and Bot2's Llanowar Elves.
